{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Immerse yourself in a world hidden away and revisit the past of this young girl.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel through a seamless and interwoven open world, uncovering the legacies left behind. <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1487970/extras/VGif_3.gif?t=1742312968\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore and gather scattered petals to unlock hidden paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1487970/extras/VGif_4.gif?t=1742312968\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interact and help out the local fauna to assist you on your journey.  <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1487970/extras/VGif_1.gif?t=1742312968\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience an emotionally gripping story about a trapped girl and a cosmic wolf.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1487970/extras/VGif_2.gif?t=1742312968\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dive into a world where every corner holds a secret, every item tells a story, and every step brings you closer to unraveling a shared past steeped in mystery and emotion.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1487970?t=1742312968","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1487970?t=1742312968","capsule_image":"https://sh